!!! oculus/input/routing.mat
!!! Input routing table.
!!!
!!! The routing table maps windows to the input they receive.
!!! Focus windows get keyboard events; hovered windows get
!!! pointer events.

book oculus.input.routing

read everything from oculus.input.focus
read everything from oculus.input.pointer
read everything from oculus.window.geometry
read everything from oculus.window.record
read everything from ny.lang.core

!!! The full input routing table.

public routing-table begin record
    field focus as input-focus
    field pointer-state as pointer-state
    field viewport-width as override long
    field viewport-height as override long
end record
